s, manual_review, and missing MS cases. It keeps document_only unavailable for in-app full-document reveal and keeps legal/display/release posture separate.\n\nGenerated outputs:\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.readback.md\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.validator-result.v1.json\n\n## Count Inventory\n\n- total runtime rows: 3530\n- total question groups: 3530\n- question_range_located rows/groups: 32 / 32\n- single_page_located rows/groups: 598 / 598\n- multi_page rows/groups: 32 / 32\n- partial_question_located rows/groups: 5 / 5\n- document_only rows/groups: 1563 / 1563\n- ambiguous rows/groups: 1058 / 1058\n- manual_review rows/groups: 274 / 274\n- missing MS rows/groups: 0 / 0\n- includes_all_subparts true / false / unknown: 630 / 5 / 2895\n- locator confidence rows: high 630, medium 0, low 5, blocked 2895\n\n## Validation\n\n- npm run method-map:build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator\n- npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-page-locator-backfill-all-3530.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-reveal-boundary.test.js\n- ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-question-level-page-range-locator.test.js\n- npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json\n\nSide-effect receipt remains zero for production Supabase/storage/RAG/vector mutation, OCR/VLM, external model calls, and raw MS text storage as student-facing content.","created_at":"2026-07-09T16:05:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T16:21:16Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T16:21:16Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T16:21:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"541